.TH "INSPEKT\-ZOOM" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-zoom \- Get or set browser zoom level.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]zoom\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
\f[I]SUBCOMMAND\f[R] [\f[I]ARGS\f[R]]\&...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Get or set browser zoom level.
.PP
Without arguments, shows the current zoom level.
With a number, sets the zoom to that percentage.
.PP
Subcommands: in, out, reset.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\(enwcag\f[R]
Set zoom to 200% (WCAG 1.4.4 Resize Text)
.TP
\f[B]\(enreflow\f[R]
Set zoom to 400% (WCAG 1.4.10 Reflow)
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
Output as JSON
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
\f[B]in\f[R]
Zoom in to the next predefined level.
.TP
\f[B]out\f[R]
Zoom out to the previous predefined level.
.TP
\f[B]reset\f[R]
Reset zoom to 100%.
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
inspekt zoom
inspekt zoom 150
inspekt zoom in
inspekt zoom out
inspekt zoom reset
inspekt zoom \-\-wcag
inspekt zoom \-\-reflow
inspekt zoom \-\-json
.EE
